e over its last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"8 scores, the E32 veto, the 1 s revoke hold), and the frame carries","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that session’s decision. ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" while there is no verdict","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"yet, with no or several faces, or when the image is missing. Too near","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and too far are hints in ","type":"text"},{"code":"framing","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only: the face is still scored. A frame the models cannot grade keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the last verdict for up to 1.5 s, as Android does. Read the answer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from ","type":"text"},{"code":"result.isLive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (one detected face, ","type":"text"},{"code":"isConfident()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). A face gone","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for ","type":"text"},{"code":"FrameCadence.faceLossDebounceSeconds","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" empties the session, so","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the next face is judged on its own frames.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/YEOFRSDK/detectFaces(params:needFaceRect:isolation:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Processes one video frame and returns face detection\/recognition","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"results. Public (0.5.5 surface shape): the Flutter and React Native","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bridges feed camera frames through this directly.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/YEOFRSDK\/detectFaces(params:needFaceRect:isolation:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/yeofrsdk\/detectfaces(params:needfacerect:isolation:)","role":"symbol","title":"detect